{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR NAME IS OMENZIA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as an elderly woman with a dark past, and a criminal background to match. Choose your unlawful skills and set out to find your missing family amidst a vampire dictatorship run by the Blood Junta.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144100/extras/ecac81ae7f3eeee3797c596b640df37c.avif?t=1767963153\" width=363 height=521 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>A CITY RULED WITH A BLOODY IRON FIST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave behind the dubious safety of the country life and head to Bah\u00eda Blanca, a city seething with civil turmoil where fear, suspicion, and even blood are commonplace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144100/extras/8887bcfc274e42284cfc8e87f3dd763b.avif?t=1767963153\" width=1095 height=798 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ARE YOU A REBEL OR A TURNCOAT?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Blood Junta keeps humanity under its thumb, indebting citizens through the Blood Tribute. However, the Dead Hand freedom fighters seek to overthrow their regime by any means necessary. Will you join the revolution, or betray it to save those you hold dearest?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144100/extras/cd83d3a899d38879c20c53b0d2da42ae.avif?t=1767963153\" width=699 height=851 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4144100?t=1767963153","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144100/0f312f7ed66a134b772b9d404c841e03348e5914/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767963153","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144100/627e41c6c9c04da03827dd2b6a5787714df02fc0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767963153","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144100/627e41c6c9c04da03827dd2b6a5787714df02fc0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767963153","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Depictions of police and military brutality, ideological extremism, state terrorism, terrorism, murder, guns, illicit substances, use of tobacco, oppression of minorities and marginalized groups."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR NAME IS OMENZIA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as an elderly woman with a dark past, and a criminal background to match. Choose your unlawful skills and set out to find your missing family amidst a vampire dictatorship run by the Blood Junta.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144100/extras/ecac81ae7f3eeee3797c596b640df37c.avif?t=1767963153\" width=363 height=521 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>A CITY RULED WITH A BLOODY IRON FIST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave behind the dubious safety of the country life and head to Bah\u00eda Blanca, a city seething with civil turmoil where fear, suspicion, and even blood are commonplace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144100/extras/8887bcfc274e42284cfc8e87f3dd763b.avif?t=1767963153\" width=1095 height=798 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ARE Y